## Session Bootstrap

On any new conversation, read in this order before acting:

1. `CURRENT_STATUS_AND_NEXT_STEPS.md` — operational state (what's active, blockers,
   exact next commands). Always.
2. `project-memory/decisions.md` — only if the task involves an architectural /
   threshold / scope choice.
3. `project-memory/architecture.md` — only if touching invariants.
4. `project-memory/experiments.md` — only if running or interpreting evals.

See `project-memory/README.md` for the four-layer model and the size-discipline
rules (5–10 line cap per entry; link to docs instead of compressing them).

